+### CR-DEA-BC-61: Business Object Cross-Catalog Reverse References (CR-BO-05 companion)
+
+The upstream business-objects catalog's first admission (CR-BO-05, dea-catalog-business-objects PR #11 — 8 canonical records in the org-wide `objects:object-*` id form) unblocks CR-DEA-BC-58's U-1 disposition. This CR lands the reverse direction: the schema gains an optional id-typed `business_object_refs[]` (org-wide pattern, EGV-006 resolution contract), populated on the 9 capabilities that CR-BO-05 references via `capabilities_consumed[]` — exact inverse edges, no new semantic claims. The CR-DEA-BC-58 register's upstream status is refreshed; the legacy free-text `business_object` labels stay verbatim (register surface). All gates re-verified: schema 29/29, IDM, relationship integrity, entity system, authorship, CR-index, catalog index.
+
 ### CR-DEA-BC-60: Business Capability Enrichment Tranche Closure
 
 Completion tranche Batch C — the closure assessment. `docs/BUSINESS-CAPABILITY-ENRICHMENT-CLOSURE-REPORT.md` reconciles all nineteen workstreams (BC-41..59, PRs #94–#112) with per-CR evidence, maintains the residual-work register RES-1..RES-9 (each with impact, classification, owner, next action, and closure condition — typed-relationship population open by evidence policy; realization deferred on the upstream processes gap; U-1/U-2 blocked on empty/absent upstream catalogs; two compound business_object values pending review; naming advisories; CI-hygiene deferral; reciprocity observation), and states ten separate programme conclusions without any composite score. The integrity report was regenerated at the assessed revision (15/15 automated dimensions pass). Release-readiness decision record `docs/reports/RELEASE-READINESS-RRR-2026-01.md`: **Ready** under the CR-52 criteria at the evaluated revision — explicitly an assessment artifact: no release, tag, or publication is declared or performed (the release-cut procedure owns that decision). Programme verdict: the documentation-and-governance programme complete; the enrichment programme **conditionally complete with explicit residuals**.
